{
  "work_id": "titus-paul-ab/phlm",
  "source_path": "titus-paul-ab/phlm.json",
  "source_language": "oge",
  "target_language": "eng",
  "provenance": {
    "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04": {
      "model": "claude-opus-5-5",
      "prompt_version": "bulk-2026-10-12",
      "date": "2026-11-04",
      "script": "__main__"
    }
  },
  "translations": [
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-paul-ab/phlm#Phlm.1.1",
      "source_sha256": "d318b9061087be1e",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "Paul, a prisoner of Christ Jesus, and Timothy our brother, to Philemon, our beloved and fellow worker,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-paul-ab/phlm#Phlm.1.2",
      "source_sha256": "cdc3be42812f841e",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "and to Apphia our sister, and to Archippus, our fellow contender, and to the assemblies of your house."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-paul-ab/phlm#Phlm.1.3",
      "source_sha256": "d7807724f95a5d83",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Grace to you and peace from God our Father and our Lord Jesus Christ."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-paul-ab/phlm#Phlm.1.4",
      "source_sha256": "d8c80840bfd898d9",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "I give thanks to my God, always making remembrance of you in my prayers."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-paul-ab/phlm#Phlm.1.5",
      "source_sha256": "28374b499e9af358",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "I hear of that love and faith of yours which you have toward the Lord Jesus Christ and toward all the saints,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-paul-ab/phlm#Phlm.1.6",
      "source_sha256": "c350f09aac8f8820",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "so that the fellowship of your faith may be made effective through the knowledge of every good thing that is among us through Christ Jesus."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-paul-ab/phlm#Phlm.1.7",
      "source_sha256": "93d3026ca5b6260c",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "For I had great joy and consolation because of your love, because the hearts of the saints have been refreshed through you, brother."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-paul-ab/phlm#Phlm.1.8",
      "source_sha256": "57fd403762544541",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "Therefore, though I have great boldness through Christ Jesus to command you what is easy,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-paul-ab/phlm#Phlm.1.9",
      "source_sha256": "6e5584264bcabe02",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "yet for love's sake I rather entreat you, being such as I am, Paul, an old man, and now also a prisoner of Christ Jesus."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-paul-ab/phlm#Phlm.1.10",
      "source_sha256": "dc62f5c1d827a7bb",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "I entreat you for my child Onesimus, whom I have begotten in my bonds,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-paul-ab/phlm#Phlm.1.11",
      "source_sha256": "fd2e267d1a0f956b",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "who was once useless to you, but now is useful to me and to you, and whom I have sent to you."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-paul-ab/phlm#Phlm.1.12",
      "source_sha256": "269c27fce9a7568d",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "But you, receive him, that is, my own heart,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-paul-ab/phlm#Phlm.1.13",
      "source_sha256": "e748a22341db47ad",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "whom I wished to keep with me, so that he might serve me in your place in these bonds of the Gospel."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-paul-ab/phlm#Phlm.1.14",
      "source_sha256": "6a9002f07f102c6b",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "But I did not wish to do anything without your consent, so that your good deed might not be as if by compulsion, but willingly."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-paul-ab/phlm#Phlm.1.15",
      "source_sha256": "dfb94ade305d6943",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "Who knows, perhaps it was for this very reason that he was separated from you for a time, so that you might take him back forever,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-paul-ab/phlm#Phlm.1.16",
      "source_sha256": "f99852ee061a93e3",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "no longer as a slave, but as more than a slave, a beloved brother. Since he is so to me, how much more to you, both in the flesh and in the Lord!"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-paul-ab/phlm#Phlm.1.17",
      "source_sha256": "62951a8688bda220",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "If you count me as a partner, receive him as you would me."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-paul-ab/phlm#Phlm.1.18",
      "source_sha256": "62837e33f753d5bd",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "If he has wronged you in anything or owes you anything, charge that to me; I will repay it."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-paul-ab/phlm#Phlm.1.19",
      "source_sha256": "746308371e9c6078",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "I, Paul, have written this with my own hand, so that I may not say to you that you too are indebted to me."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-paul-ab/phlm#Phlm.1.20",
      "source_sha256": "6ce954959a84c874",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "Yes, brother, I have gained you in the Lord; refresh my heart through Christ Jesus."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-paul-ab/phlm#Phlm.1.21",
      "source_sha256": "4bc45828d39148c3",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "I have written to you trusting in your obedience, knowing that you will indeed do what I am telling you."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-paul-ab/phlm#Phlm.1.22",
      "source_sha256": "10af7c044da4e7f3",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "And along with this, prepare lodging for me as well, for I trust that through your prayers I shall be granted to you."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-paul-ab/phlm#Phlm.1.23",
      "source_sha256": "8ff26023044f394c",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "Epaphras, my fellow captive through Christ Jesus, greets you,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-paul-ab/phlm#Phlm.1.24",
      "source_sha256": "a8101a6a2e7fb11c",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "as do Mark, Aristarchus, Demas, and Luke, my fellow helpers."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-paul-ab/phlm#Phlm.1.25",
      "source_sha256": "af5741fda104d5bf",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "Grace be with you. Amen."
    }
  ]
}
